### Configuting key rotation and access policies
- Asymmetric keys or imported keys won't have automatic way to configure key rotation
- symmetric keys will have option to rotate keys
- cli command to check whether key rotation enabled/disabled for specific key
  aws kms get-key-rotation-status --key-id <key-id>
- cli command to disable/enable key rotation for specific key
  aws kms disable-key-rotation --key-id <key-id>
  aws kms enable-key-rotation --key-id <key-id>

