### Deploying a Private Certificate Authority
- a CA purpose is to issue PKI certificates, or to create a subordinate CA which in turn will issue certificates
- With a private CA, chain of trust is very important, since it is private CA, it is not trusted by any devices
- Devices will have a list of trusted public CAs whos certicates they will trust
- we have to install root key of private CA on devices to trust CA certificates
